{"seq":1,"slug":"os-tuning","title":"操作系统调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/os-tuning","wordCount":823,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"操作系统调优\">操作系统调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>操作系统是应用程序和硬件之间的桥梁，其内核参数直接影响系统性能的上限。Linux 的默认配置针对通用场景，但对于高性能服务器、数据库或低延迟交易系统，通常需要针对性调优。操作系统调优涉及 CPU 调度、内存管理、文件系统、网络栈和资源限制等多个子系统，核心原则是<strong>减少内核干预、降低上下文切换、最大化硬件利用率</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[操作系统调优] --&gt; B[CPU 调度]&#10;    A --&gt; C[内存管理]&#10;    A --&gt; D[文件系统]&#10;    A --&gt; E[网络栈]&#10;    A --&gt; F[资源限制]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[调度器策略]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[CPU 亲和性]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[中断亲和性]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Swap 策略]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Huge Pages]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[NUMA 感知]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[挂载选项]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[预读配置]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[TCP 参数]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[缓冲区大小]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[文件描述符]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[进程数限制]\">graph TB\n    A[操作系统调优] --&gt; B[CPU 调度]\n    A --&gt; C[内存管理]\n    A --&gt; D[文件系统]\n    A --&gt; E[网络栈]\n    A --&gt; F[资源限制]\n    B --&gt; B1[调度器策略]\n    B --&gt; B2[CPU 亲和性]\n    B --&gt; B3[中断亲和性]\n    C --&gt; C1[Swap 策略]\n    C --&gt; C2[Huge Pages]\n    C --&gt; C3[NUMA 感知]\n    D --&gt; D1[挂载选项]\n    D --&gt; D2[预读配置]\n    E --&gt; E1[TCP 参数]\n    E --&gt; E2[缓冲区大小]\n    F --&gt; F1[文件描述符]\n    F --&gt; F2[进程数限制]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调优维度</th>\n<th>默认值/行为</th>\n<th>高性能推荐</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vm.swappiness</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>1-10</td>\n<td>减少 swap 使用，避免延迟波动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vm.overcommit_memory</td>\n<td>0 (启发式)</td>\n<td>1 (总是允许)</td>\n<td>避免 OOM 在 fork 时误杀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>net.core.somaxconn</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>65535</td>\n<td>TCP 连接队列上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fs.file-max</td>\n<td>~100K</td>\n<td>2000000</td>\n<td>系统级文件描述符上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>kernel.sched_migration_cost_ns</td>\n<td>500000</td>\n<td>5000000</td>\n<td>减少进程在 CPU 间迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>transparent_hugepage</td>\n<td>always</td>\n<td>madvise</td>\n<td>避免 THP 引起的延迟抖动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-调度与绑核\">CPU 调度与绑核</h2><p>Linux 的 CFS（Completely Fair Scheduler）调度器在通用场景下表现良好，但在低延迟场景中，进程在 CPU 核心之间的迁移会导致缓存失效和延迟抖动。<strong>CPU 亲和性</strong>（CPU Affinity）可以将进程或线程绑定到特定的 CPU 核心，避免迁移。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看进程的 CPU 亲和性&#10;taskset -p $(pgrep myapp)&#10;&#10;# 绑定进程到 CPU 0-3&#10;taskset -c 0-3 ./myapp&#10;&#10;# 运行时修改&#10;taskset -p -c 4-7 $(pgrep myapp)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看进程的 CPU 亲和性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">taskset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 绑定进程到 CPU 0-3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">taskset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 0-3</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行时修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">taskset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 4-7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在代码中设置 CPU 亲和性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"#define _GNU_SOURCE&#10;#include &lt;sched.h&gt;&#10;#include &lt;pthread.h&gt;&#10;&#10;void pin_thread_to_core(int core_id) {&#10;    cpu_set_t cpuset;&#10;    CPU_ZERO(&amp;cpuset);&#10;    CPU_SET(core_id, &amp;cpuset);&#10;    pthread_setaffinity_np(pthread_self(), sizeof(cpuset), &amp;cpuset);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void setup_worker_threads(int num_workers) {&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; num_workers; i++) {&#10;        pthread_t thread;&#10;        pthread_create(&amp;thread, NULL, worker_fn, (void*)(long)i);&#10;        cpu_set_t cpuset;&#10;        CPU_ZERO(&amp;cpuset);&#10;        CPU_SET(i + 2, &amp;cpuset);  // 保留 CPU 0-1 给系统和中断&#10;        pthread_setaffinity_np(thread, sizeof(cpuset), &amp;cpuset);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _GNU_SOURCE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;sched.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;pthread.h></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pin_thread_to_core</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> core_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cpu_set_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cpuset;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    CPU_ZERO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    CPU_SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(core_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    pthread_setaffinity_np</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pthread_self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cpuset), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setup_worker_threads</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> num_workers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_workers; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        pthread_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        pthread_create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">thread, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, worker_fn, (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">long</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)i);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        cpu_set_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cpuset;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        CPU_ZERO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        CPU_SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 保留 CPU 0-1 给系统和中断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        pthread_setaffinity_np</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(thread, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cpuset), </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">cpuset);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>中断亲和性</strong>同样重要。网络中断如果集中在一个 CPU 核心上，会导致该核心过载。使用 <code>irqbalance</code> 或手动分配中断到不同核心：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看中断分布&#10;cat /proc/interrupts | head -20&#10;&#10;# 手动将网卡中断绑定到特定 CPU&#10;echo 2 &gt; /proc/irq/28/smp_affinity   # 绑定到 CPU 1 (bitmask: 10)&#10;&#10;# 使用 RPS (Receive Packet Steering) 分散网络处理&#10;echo &quot;ff&quot; &gt; /sys/class/net/eth0/queues/rx-0/rps_cpus\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看中断分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/interrupts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动将网卡中断绑定到特定 CPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/irq/28/smp_affinity</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   # 绑定到 CPU 1 (bitmask: 10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 RPS (Receive Packet Steering) 分散网络处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"ff\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/class/net/eth0/queues/rx-0/rps_cpus</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于延迟极度敏感的应用（如高频交易），可以使用 <strong>isolcpus</strong> 将 CPU 核心完全隔离，避免内核在这些核心上调度其他任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 在 GRUB 启动参数中隔离 CPU 4-7&#10;GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX=&quot;isolcpus=4-7 nohz_full=4-7 rcu_nocbs=4-7&quot;&#10;# 然后用 taskset 将关键进程绑定到隔离的核心上\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在 GRUB 启动参数中隔离 CPU 4-7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">GRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"isolcpus=4-7 nohz_full=4-7 rcu_nocbs=4-7\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 然后用 taskset 将关键进程绑定到隔离的核心上</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存管理调优\">内存管理调优</h2><p><strong>Swap</strong> 的使用是性能调优中最常见的议题。swap 允许系统在物理内存不足时将页面交换到磁盘，但磁盘速度比内存慢几个数量级。对于内存充足的服务器，应将 swappiness 降低：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 几乎不使用 swap（但不完全禁用，保留紧急情况的缓冲）&#10;sysctl -w vm.swappiness=1&#10;&#10;# 完全禁用 swap（数据库推荐）&#10;swapoff -a\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 几乎不使用 swap（但不完全禁用，保留紧急情况的缓冲）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vm.swappiness=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 完全禁用 swap（数据库推荐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">swapoff</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>大页内存</strong>（Huge Pages）将默认的 4KB 内存页增大到 2MB 或 1GB，减少 TLB 条目数量和页表层级，对大内存应用（如数据库、JVM）有显著性能提升：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 静态大页（预留 8GB = 4096 个 2MB 页）&#10;echo 4096 &gt; /proc/sys/vm/nr_hugepages&#10;# 挂载 hugetlbfs&#10;mkdir -p /mnt/hugepages&#10;mount -t hugetlbfs nodev /mnt/hugepages&#10;&#10;# 透明大页 THP（不需要应用修改）&#10;# 但 THP 的后台碎片整理可能导致延迟抖动，数据库通常建议关闭&#10;echo madvise &gt; /sys/kernel/mm/transparent_hugepage/enabled&#10;echo madvise &gt; /sys/kernel/mm/transparent_hugepage/defrag\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 静态大页（预留 8GB = 4096 个 2MB 页）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4096</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/sys/vm/nr_hugepages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 挂载 hugetlbfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/hugepages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mount</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hugetlbfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nodev</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /mnt/hugepages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 透明大页 THP（不需要应用修改）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 但 THP 的后台碎片整理可能导致延迟抖动，数据库通常建议关闭</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> madvise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/kernel/mm/transparent_hugepage/enabled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> madvise</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/kernel/mm/transparent_hugepage/defrag</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>NUMA 感知</strong>在多路服务器上至关重要。非一致内存访问（NUMA）架构中，每个 CPU 插槽有本地内存，访问本地内存比远端内存快 30-50%。应用应尽量在本地 NUMA 节点上分配内存：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看 NUMA 拓扑&#10;numactl --hardware&#10;&#10;# 绑定到特定 NUMA 节点&#10;numactl --cpunodebind=0 --membind=0 ./myapp&#10;&#10;# 查看 NUMA 统计&#10;numastat -p $(pgrep myapp)&#10;# 关注 numa_miss 和 numa_foreign：非零表示跨节点访问\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 NUMA 拓扑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">numactl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hardware</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 绑定到特定 NUMA 节点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">numactl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --cpunodebind=0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --membind=0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看 NUMA 统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">numastat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pgrep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关注 numa_miss 和 numa_foreign：非零表示跨节点访问</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"文件描述符与系统限制\">文件描述符与系统限制</h2><p>Linux 的资源限制（ulimit）默认值通常过低，在高并发场景下会成为瓶颈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看当前限制&#10;ulimit -a&#10;&#10;# 设置打开文件数限制（临时）&#10;ulimit -n 1000000&#10;&#10;# 永久设置（/etc/security/limits.conf）&#10;# *    soft    nofile    1000000&#10;# *    hard    nofile    1000000&#10;# *    soft    nproc     500000&#10;# *    hard    nproc     500000&#10;&#10;# 系统级限制&#10;sysctl -w fs.file-max=2000000&#10;sysctl -w fs.nr_open=2000000&#10;&#10;# inotify 限制（影响文件监控）&#10;sysctl -w fs.inotify.max_user_watches=524288&#10;sysctl -w fs.inotify.max_user_instances=1024\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看当前限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ulimit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 设置打开文件数限制（临时）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ulimit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 永久设置（/etc/security/limits.conf）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *    soft    nofile    1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *    hard    nofile    1000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *    soft    nproc     500000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># *    hard    nproc     500000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 系统级限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fs.file-max=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fs.nr_open=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># inotify 限制（影响文件监控）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fs.inotify.max_user_watches=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">524288</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fs.inotify.max_user_instances=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"综合调优示例\">综合调优示例</h2><p>以下是一个面向高性能 Web 服务的综合调优配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# /etc/sysctl.d/99-perf.conf&#10;&#10;# 内存&#10;vm.swappiness=1&#10;vm.overcommit_memory=1&#10;vm.dirty_ratio=40&#10;vm.dirty_background_ratio=10&#10;&#10;# 网络&#10;net.core.somaxconn=65535&#10;net.core.netdev_max_backlog=65535&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog=65535&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse=1&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout=10&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_time=60&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_intvl=10&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_probes=6&#10;net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range=1024 65535&#10;net.core.rmem_max=16777216&#10;net.core.wmem_max=16777216&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_rmem=4096 1048576 16777216&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_wmem=4096 1048576 16777216&#10;net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control=bbr&#10;net.core.default_qdisc=fq&#10;&#10;# 文件系统&#10;fs.file-max=2000000&#10;fs.inotify.max_user_watches=524288\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># /etc/sysctl.d/99-perf.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vm.swappiness</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vm.overcommit_memory</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vm.dirty_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=40</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vm.dirty_background_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 网络</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.core.somaxconn</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=65535</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.core.netdev_max_backlog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=65535</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=65535</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_tw_reuse</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_fin_timeout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_time</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_intvl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_keepalive_probes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=1024</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 65535</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.core.rmem_max</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.core.wmem_max</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_rmem</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=4096</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1048576</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_wmem</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=4096</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1048576</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 16777216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.ipv4.tcp_congestion_control</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=bbr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net.core.default_qdisc</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=fq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 文件系统</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fs.file-max</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=2000000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fs.inotify.max_user_watches</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">=524288</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[基准测试] --&gt; B[识别瓶颈]&#10;    B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型}&#10;    C --&gt;|CPU| D[调度/绑核/isolcpus]&#10;    C --&gt;|内存| E[Swap/HugePages/NUMA]&#10;    C --&gt;|网络| F[TCP参数/缓冲区/BBR]&#10;    C --&gt;|文件| G[ulimit/noatime/调度器]&#10;    D --&gt; H[验证效果]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I{达标?}&#10;    I --&gt;|否| B&#10;    I --&gt;|是| J[生产部署]\">graph LR\n    A[基准测试] --&gt; B[识别瓶颈]\n    B --&gt; C{瓶颈类型}\n    C --&gt;|CPU| D[调度/绑核/isolcpus]\n    C --&gt;|内存| E[Swap/HugePages/NUMA]\n    C --&gt;|网络| F[TCP参数/缓冲区/BBR]\n    C --&gt;|文件| G[ulimit/noatime/调度器]\n    D --&gt; H[验证效果]\n    E --&gt; H\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I{达标?}\n    I --&gt;|否| B\n    I --&gt;|是| J[生产部署]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((OS 调优))&#10;    CPU&#10;      CFS 调度器&#10;      CPU 亲和性&#10;      中断亲和性&#10;      isolcpus 隔离&#10;    内存&#10;      swappiness&#10;      Huge Pages&#10;      NUMA 感知&#10;      THP 管理&#10;    网络&#10;      TCP 参数&#10;      连接队列&#10;      BBR 拥塞控制&#10;    资源限制&#10;      文件描述符&#10;      进程数&#10;      inotify&#10;    方法论&#10;      基准测试先行&#10;      逐项调优&#10;      验证回归\">mindmap\n  root((OS 调优))\n    CPU\n      CFS 调度器\n      CPU 亲和性\n      中断亲和性\n      isolcpus 隔离\n    内存\n      swappiness\n      Huge Pages\n      NUMA 感知\n      THP 管理\n    网络\n      TCP 参数\n      连接队列\n      BBR 拥塞控制\n    资源限制\n      文件描述符\n      进程数\n      inotify\n    方法论\n      基准测试先行\n      逐项调优\n      验证回归</pre><ul>\n<li>操作系统调优的第一步是<strong>测量基准</strong>，而非盲目修改参数</li>\n<li><strong>CPU 亲和性和中断亲和性</strong>减少核心间迁移，对低延迟场景至关重要</li>\n<li>生产服务器应将 <strong>swappiness</strong> 降至 1-10，数据库建议完全禁用 swap</li>\n<li><strong>透明大页</strong>（THP）对数据库可能有害——设为 <code>madvise</code> 让应用自行决定</li>\n<li><strong>NUMA 感知</strong>在多路服务器上可带来 30-50% 的内存访问性能差异</li>\n<li>文件描述符和连接队列的默认限制通常过低，高并发服务必须调整</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"操作系统调优","id":"操作系统调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU 调度与绑核","id":"cpu-调度与绑核"},{"level":2,"text":"内存管理调优","id":"内存管理调优"},{"level":2,"text":"文件描述符与系统限制","id":"文件描述符与系统限制"},{"level":2,"text":"综合调优示例","id":"综合调优示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异步 I/O 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/io-optimization/async-io-patterns"},"next":{"title":"容器性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-performance/system-tuning/container-performance"}}